<title>HONG KONG: Peregrine ups Sino Land warrants.</title>
<headline>Peregrine ups Sino Land warrants.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Peregrine Derivatives Ltd said on Thursday it has increased its issue of American-style call warrants on shares of Sino Land Co Ltd to 500 million warrants.</p>
<p>It gave no details on the previous issue.</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE	HK$9.98     PREMIUM	 22.86 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	 HK$0.1569   GEARING	 6.0X</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	  17.NOV.97   PAYDATE	 2 WKS AFTER LAUNCH</p>
<p> LISTING	     HONG KONG   MIN EXER LOT  20,000</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE    HK$9.40</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
